msgid "Match on a pane or hit it with a tool to light it. Light them all to finish."
msgstr "유리창 위에서 매치를 만들거나 도구로 쳐서 불을 켜세요. 모두 켜면 끝나요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/screens.lua
msgid "Match the tied piece or hit it with a tool. Then clear the piece to light the pane."
msgstr "묶인 조각을 맞추거나 도구로 치세요. 그다음 조각을 지우면 유리창에 불이 켜져요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/screens.lua
msgid "Replay complete"
msgstr "다시 하기 완료"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/screens.lua
msgid "Stock the market"
msgstr "장터를 채워요"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/screens.lua
msgid "Swap it with a neighbor to clear every piece of that kind."
msgstr "이웃한 조각과 바꾸면 그 종류의 조각이 모두 지워져요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/screens.lua
msgid "The Firework stall replaces the hammer and keeps its charge. Tap a cell to hit a 3×3 square."
msgstr "불꽃놀이 가게가 망치를 대신하고 충전도 그대로예요. 칸을 누르면 3×3 영역을 쳐요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/screens.lua
msgid "The bakery swaps mulled wine for gingerbread men. The cocoa kiosk puts hot cocoa on the board."
msgstr "빵집은 뱅쇼를 진저브레드 맨으로 바꿔요. 코코아 키오스크는 핫코코아를 판에 올려요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/screens.lua
msgid "Untangle tinsel"
msgstr "틴셀을 풀어요"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/screens.lua
msgid "Winter treats"
msgstr "겨울 간식"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/screens.lua
msgid "Wish granted!"
msgstr "소원이 이루어졌어요!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "A TELEGRAM! MUM'S ON THE LAST TRAIN ON CHRISTMAS EVE! SHE'S COMING!"
msgstr "전보다! 엄마가 크리스마스 이브 마지막 기차로 온대! 오신대!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "A candle for every window on the square, and a spare. Somebody always comes home late."
msgstr "광장의 창문마다 초 하나씩, 그리고 여분 하나. 늦게 돌아오는 사람은 늘 있으니까."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "A dry roof for the planks. They won't warp in the snow now."
msgstr "판자가 마른 지붕 아래 있게 됐어요. 이제 눈이 와도 휘지 않을 거예요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "A furnace of my own. Three breaths for a bauble, five for a big one."
msgstr "드디어 내 가마예요. 장식 공은 숨 세 번, 큰 건 다섯 번이면 돼요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "A kiosk with a clock. Trains run late in the snow, but this clock won't."
msgstr "시계가 달린 키오스크예요. 눈이 오면 기차는 늦어도, 이 시계는 안 늦어요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "A proper bench, and a window. My soldiers can face the square now."
msgstr "제대로 된 작업대에 창문까지. 이제 내 병정들이 광장을 바라볼 수 있겠어요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "A proper oven at last. First gingerbread's yours, love. Don't argue, just eat it."
msgstr "드디어 제대로 된 오븐이야. 첫 진저브레드는 네 거란다, 얘야. 사양하지 말고 그냥 먹어."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "A real post office, with a stamp that goes clunk! Got any letters for Santa?"
msgstr "진짜 우체국이야, 쿵 하고 찍히는 도장도 있고! 산타에게 보낼 편지 있어?"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "A sleigh, with real bells! Mr Wren, have you ever driven one?"
msgstr "진짜 방울이 달린 썰매예요! 렌 씨, 몰아 본 적 있으세요?"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "A sound roof on the chapel. The choir will be glad of it. So will the pigeons."
msgstr "성당 지붕이 튼튼해졌어요. 성가대가 좋아하겠어요. 비둘기들도요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "A wooden train for the Fenwick boy. The wheels must turn without a squeak."
msgstr "펜윅네 아이에게 줄 나무 기차예요. 바퀴가 삐걱 소리 없이 굴러가야 해요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Ada, it's beautiful. It catches the whole evening."
msgstr "에이다, 정말 아름다워요. 저녁 풍경이 통째로 담겼어요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "All this, in one December? Noelle, love, I'd never have believed it."
msgstr "이걸 한 달 만에요? 노엘, 얘야, 나는 믿지 못했을 거야."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Beeswax and cinnamon. The whole square smells of it, Mr Wren."
msgstr "밀랍과 계피 냄새예요. 광장 전체에서 나요, 렌 씨."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Better do as she says. Nobody's ever won an argument with Agnes."
msgstr "시키는 대로 하는 게 낫겠어요. 아그네스랑 말다툼해서 이긴 사람은 없으니까요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Can I do the wrapping? I'm brilliant at bows!"
msgstr "제가 포장해도 돼요? 저 리본 매듭 진짜 잘 지어요!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Can we watch, Ada? I've never seen glass made."
msgstr "구경해도 돼요, 에이다? 유리 만드는 거 본 적 없어요!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Carollers at every door tonight! Open yours and you get a song. Don't, and you get two."
msgstr "오늘 밤엔 집집마다 캐럴을 불러 줘요! 문을 열면 한 곡, 안 열면 두 곡이에요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Choir practice tonight, and you're both coming. Somebody has to stand next to me."
msgstr "오늘 밤 성가대 연습이에요. 두 분 다 오세요. 제 옆에 서 줄 사람이 필요하거든요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Cocoa with cream, and a pinch of cinnamon. First cup's on me, dear."
msgstr "생크림에 계피 한 꼬집을 넣은 코코아예요. 첫 잔은 내가 살게, 얘야."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Come in when you get cold, love. There's buns."
msgstr "추우면 들어오렴, 얘야. 빵 있단다."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Every house on the square gets one. It's a market rule."
msgstr "광장의 집마다 하나씩 줘요. 장터 규칙이에요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Everyone else? That's not a team, Pip. That's the whole town."
msgstr "나머지 모두라고? 그건 팀이 아니라 온 마을이야, 핍."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Fireworks! Can I light one? Just a little one?"
msgstr "불꽃놀이다! 제가 불 붙여도 돼요? 아주 작은 거 하나만요!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "First Sunday of Advent. You light the first candle on the wreath, love. New hands bring luck."
msgstr "대림절 첫 일요일이야. 리스의 첫 초는 네가 켜렴, 얘야. 새 손이 복을 가져온단다."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Frost ferns on every window this morning. Clever things."
msgstr "오늘 아침 창마다 서리 고사리가 피었네. 참 영리하기도 하지."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Go on, Pip. Flat hand, and mind your fingers."
msgstr "해 봐, 핍. 손바닥을 펴고, 손가락 조심하고."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Go on. Make a wish while you're at it."
msgstr "해 봐. 하는 김에 소원도 빌고."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Good. My butter goes in first, Theo."
msgstr "좋아. 내 버터가 먼저 들어가야 해요, 테오."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Hello! I'm Pip, I do the post. Are you the new helper? You've got snow on your hat."
msgstr "안녕! 나는 핍이고 우편을 맡고 있어. 새 도우미야? 모자에 눈이 앉았어."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "I didn't do it on my own, Gran. Merry Christmas, everyone."
msgstr "저 혼자 한 거 아니에요, 할머니. 모두들 메리 크리스마스!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "I haven't skated since I was a girl. Hold my arm, love. Don't let go."
msgstr "소녀 때 이후로 스케이트는 처음이야. 팔 좀 잡아 줘, 얘야. 놓으면 안 돼."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "I made a paper chain as long as the square, out of last week's newspaper!"
msgstr "지난주 신문으로 광장만큼 긴 종이 사슬을 만들었어요!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "I've got you, Agnes. Look, you're doing it!"
msgstr "잡고 있어요, 아그네스. 봐요, 타고 있잖아요!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "I've kept a little fir back. For your gran's window, if you want it."
msgstr "작은 전나무를 하나 남겨 뒀어. 네 할머니 창가에 두고 싶으면 가져가."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Ice from the lake, cut and stacked. Mr Finch says it gets thicker every week."
msgstr "호수에서 잘라 쌓은 얼음이에요. 핀치 씨 말로는 매주 두꺼워진대요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Ice is thick enough on the lake now. Bramble's been out on it since Tuesday."
msgstr "이제 호수 얼음이 충분히 두꺼워요. 브램블은 화요일부터 그 위에 나가 있어요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Is that safe for a goat, Mr Finch?"
msgstr "염소한테 안전한 건가요, 핀치 씨?"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Is that your goat, Mr Finch? She's eating the tinsel."
msgstr "저게 핀치 씨 염소예요? 틴셀을 먹고 있는데요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "It goes round! Noelle, it actually goes round! I'm having the reindeer!"
msgstr "돌아간다! 노엘, 진짜로 돌아가요! 나는 순록 탈래요!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Just the one. Make sure he gets it, Pip."
msgstr "딱 하나만. 꼭 그 애가 받게 해 줘, 핍."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Leave your boots out tonight! St Nicholas fills them with oranges and nuts."
msgstr "오늘 밤 장화를 내놓으렴! 성 니콜라우스가 오렌지와 견과류를 채워 주신단다."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Letter for you, Noelle! From your gran!"
msgstr "노엘 앞으로 편지예요! 할머니가 보내셨어요!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Mittens are good, Theo. Who's the friend?"
msgstr "벙어리장갑 좋네요, 테오. 그 친구가 누구예요?"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Mr Bell, can I wind it? I'll be ever so careful."
msgstr "벨 씨, 제가 태엽 감아도 돼요? 아주 조심할게요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Mr Strand, do the drums really play?"
msgstr "스트란드 씨, 북이 진짜 울려요?"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Mr Wren, do you ever put that broom down?"
msgstr "렌 씨, 그 빗자루 내려놓을 때도 있어요?"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Mrs Alder sings louder than the organ. Bring a scarf."
msgstr "올더 부인은 오르간보다 목소리가 커요. 목도리 챙겨 오세요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Mrs Holt, Mr Strand says your chimney smokes and your bread's burnt."
msgstr "홀트 부인, 스트란드 씨가 굴뚝에서 연기 나고 빵도 탔대요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Mum cooks on the coastal steamer. She's trying to get home for Christmas. I don't mind either way."
msgstr "엄마는 연안 증기선에서 요리해요. 크리스마스에 집에 오려고 애쓰는 중이에요. 저는 오든 안 오든 상관없어요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Nobody lights anything before midnight on New Year's Eve, Pip."
msgstr "섣달그믐 자정 전에는 아무도 불 붙이면 안 돼, 핍."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Of course it goes round. I made the horses. Mind the reindeer, Pip, it's the fastest."
msgstr "당연히 돌아가지. 말은 내가 만들었는걸. 순록 조심해, 핍. 제일 빨라."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Once or twice, Pip. Only ever on the one night of the year."
msgstr "한두 번요, 핍. 일 년에 딱 그날 밤에만요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Pip knows everyone in Bellmere, and what they're all getting for Christmas."
msgstr "핍은 벨미어의 모든 사람을 알고, 다들 크리스마스에 뭘 받는지도 알아요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Pip! Look how you've grown. And look at this square!"
msgstr "핍! 많이 컸구나. 그리고 이 광장 좀 봐!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Pip, that's my parcel you've wrapped. And my mitten."
msgstr "핍, 그거 내 소포잖아. 내 장갑도 싸 버렸고."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Reindeer! Can I feed them? I've got carrots in both pockets!"
msgstr "순록이다! 먹이 줘도 돼요? 양쪽 주머니에 당근 있어요!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Room for carving at last. My old apprentices said they'd come if there was space."
msgstr "드디어 조각할 자리가 생겼어요. 옛 제자들이 자리만 있으면 오겠다고 했거든요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "She's coming on the last train tomorrow, Pip, with your mum!"
msgstr "내일 마지막 기차로 오신대, 핍. 네 엄마랑 같이!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Shortest day of the year. From tomorrow, a little more light every evening."
msgstr "일 년 중 가장 짧은 날이에요. 내일부터는 저녁마다 빛이 조금씩 길어져요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Smoked trout by Saturday. Bramble, that's not for you."
msgstr "토요일까지 훈제 송어 나와요. 브램블, 그건 네 거 아니야."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Snowball fight by the fountain! Theo against everyone else!"
msgstr "분수 옆에서 눈싸움이다! 테오 대 나머지 전부!"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Snowy boots and all, Pip?"
msgstr "눈 묻은 장화 그대로, 핍?"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "St Lucia's day. Saffron buns, curled like a cat's tail. Take two."
msgstr "성 루치아의 날이야. 고양이 꼬리처럼 말린 사프란 빵이지. 두 개 가져가."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Tell that man it's toasted. On purpose."
msgstr "저 사람한테 말해 줘요. 일부러 구운 거라고."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Thank you, Mrs Alder. You're humming carols already."
msgstr "고마워요, 올더 부인. 벌써 캐럴을 흥얼거리시네요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "That's Theo. He sells the trees, and he argues with everything."
msgstr "저 사람이 테오예요. 나무를 파는데, 뭐든 따지고 들어요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "That's an arch. Right. I'll sell my firs under it. Everyone walks through here."
msgstr "아치라. 좋아. 이 아래서 전나무를 팔아야겠군. 다들 여기로 지나다니니까."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "The news has never looked so festive, Pip."
msgstr "뉴스가 이렇게 축제 같았던 적이 없어, 핍."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Then she'll want a warm bun when she steps off. I'll have one ready."
msgstr "그럼 내리자마자 따뜻한 빵이 필요하겠네. 하나 준비해 둘게."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Theo Marsh. Did you just do something nice?"
msgstr "테오 마시. 방금 뭔가 좋은 일 한 거 아니에요?"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Theo, it's perfect. Did you walk the whole hill for it?"
msgstr "테오, 완벽해요. 이거 가져오려고 언덕을 다 걸어 올랐어요?"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Theo, why is there a fir tree in Gran's doorway?"
msgstr "테오, 할머니 현관에 왜 전나무가 있어요?"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "There's space now, Henrik. I hope they make it for Christmas."
msgstr "이제 자리가 있어요, 헨리크. 크리스마스에 맞춰 오면 좋겠네요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "There. The best fir I've got, right in the middle of the square."
msgstr "자. 내가 가진 제일 좋은 전나무야. 광장 한가운데에 놓았어."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "We'd better leave the door open, then."
msgstr "그럼 문을 열어 둬야겠네요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Welcome to Bellmere! Make matches to collect resources and help me rebuild the market."
msgstr "벨미어에 온 걸 환영해요! 매치로 자원을 모아서 장터를 다시 세우는 걸 도와줘요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "What do you get someone who has everything? Asking for a friend. Are mittens good?"
msgstr "다 가진 사람한테는 뭘 선물하죠? 친구 얘기예요. 벙어리장갑 괜찮을까요?"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "You make that sound like good news, Mr Wren."
msgstr "좋은 소식처럼 말씀하시네요, 렌 씨."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "You said \"take two\" yesterday, Agnes. And the day before."
msgstr "어제도 ‘두 개 가져가’라고 했잖아요, 아그네스. 그제도요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "You've been oiling that one wheel for an hour, Henrik."
msgstr "한 시간째 그 바퀴 하나에 기름칠하고 있어요, 헨리크."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "You've been out sweeping since six, Mr Wren. It snowed all night."
msgstr "여섯 시부터 쓸고 계시네요, 렌 씨. 밤새 눈이 왔는데."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "You've got sawdust in your hair, Theo. And pine needles."
msgstr "머리에 톱밥이 묻었어요, 테오. 솔잎도요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "You've read that postcard ten times today, Pip."
msgstr "그 엽서, 오늘만 열 번 읽었어, 핍."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/story_content.lua
msgid "Your window wants a star, Noelle. Blue glass. Seven breaths, it took. Hang it high."
msgstr "노엘, 창문에 별이 필요해요. 파란 유리로요. 숨을 일곱 번 불었어요. 높이 걸어요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/town_config.lua
msgid "Choose open snow clear of other buildings."
msgstr "다른 건물과 겹치지 않는 빈 눈밭을 고르세요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/town_config.lua
msgid "Drag the building to choose a spot, or scroll the land."
msgstr "건물을 끌어 자리를 고르거나 땅을 스크롤하세요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/town_config.lua
msgid "Match more pieces to earn the resources for this."
msgstr "더 많은 조각을 맞춰 필요한 자원을 모으세요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/town_config.lua
msgid "Open more land before placing this building."
msgstr "이 건물을 놓기 전에 땅을 더 여세요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/town_config.lua
msgid "Your market is unchanged."
msgstr "장터는 그대로예요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "Five in a line leave a rainbow gem. Swap it to clear one kind."
msgstr "다섯 개 한 줄이면 무지개 보석이 남아요. 바꾸면 한 종류가 지워져요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "Four in a line leave a striped gem. Match it to sweep its line."
msgstr "네 개 한 줄이면 줄무늬 보석이 남아요. 맞추면 그 줄이 쓸려 나가요."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "Henrik's old apprentices come back"
msgstr "헨리크의 옛 제자들이 돌아와요"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "Mr Wren trims every wick"
msgstr "렌 씨가 심지를 모두 다듬어요"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "Mrs Alder's ladle and second pot"
msgstr "올더 부인의 국자와 두 번째 냄비"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "a band organ"
msgstr "밴드 오르간"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "a drying shed for the pine"
msgstr "소나무를 말리는 건조장"

#. TRANSLATORS: each title names a stall's improvement, shown as "Upgraded: %s."
#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "a mulled-wine hatch in the arch"
msgstr "아치 안의 뱅쇼 창구"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "a new harness and bells for the reindeer"
msgstr "순록을 위한 새 마구와 방울"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "a rocket rack, ready in threes"
msgstr "세 발씩 준비된 로켓 선반"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "a second bench and a shop bell"
msgstr "두 번째 작업대와 가게 종"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "a second furnace"
msgstr "두 번째 가마"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "a second ice saw on the lake"
msgstr "호수의 두 번째 얼음톱"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "a second oven"
msgstr "두 번째 오븐"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "a second smoking rack"
msgstr "두 번째 훈제 선반"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "a second sorting rack"
msgstr "두 번째 분류 선반"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "a star for the top"
msgstr "꼭대기에 올릴 별"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/user_events.lua
msgid "the masons' yard behind the chapel"
msgstr "성당 뒤 석공 마당"
